        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Based on the results of testing and customer feedback, we incorporate any necessary changes into the product design, build final prototypes and complete additional testing prior to full commercial release.",
        "start_character": 2016,
        "end_character": 2221
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-009995",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-009995-f7ef004add88650b",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-009995",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For the products described above, we would expect the time from announcing a design win to the sale of the related OEM product to be roughly twelve to eighteen months, although it may vary considerably depending on the customer and application.",
        "start_character": 2567,
        "end_character": 2811
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-009995",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-009995-f7ef004add88650b",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-009995",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2022, we announced, and began the first phase of, a product development agreement with Stellantis, a top 10 global automaker, for a custom B-TRAN® power module for use in the automaker’s EV drivetrain inverters in its next generation EV platform.",
        "start_character": 3190,
        "end_character": 3439
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-009995",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-009995-f7ef004add88650b",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-009995",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In connection with this design win, we entered into a joint development agreement for a SSCB product incorporating multiple B-TRAN® devices.",
        "start_character": 6097,
        "end_character": 6237
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-009995",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-009995-f7ef004add88650b",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-009995",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To date, we are not aware of any offerings or potential offerings based on a true high efficiency bidirectional design for high power applications other than potential products based on our B-TRAN® technology.",
        "start_character": 21597,
        "end_character": 21806
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-009995",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-009995-f7ef004add88650b",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-009995",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Upon product launch, we design and build initial prototypes for testing and to solicit customer feedback.",
        "start_character": 1910,
        "end_character": 2015
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-009995",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-009995-f7ef004add88650b",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-009995",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect significantly higher volume orders from customers once we secure a design win from them, and they start to build inventory in advance of launching their OEM products.",
        "start_character": 2390,
        "end_character": 2566
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-009995",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-009995-f7ef004add88650b",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-009995",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We may engage with other power module manufacturers or others in the power semiconductor ecosystem in the future to further expand the channels to market for products incorporating our technology.",
        "start_character": 5625,
        "end_character": 5821
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-009995",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-009995-f7ef004add88650b",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-009995",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we initially focused on the development of a BD-IGBT under the ARPA-E grant, we shifted our focus under the grant to the development of a new, highly efficient power switch called a bidirectional bipolar junction transistor, or B-TRAN®, that would allow product manufacturers to substitute one B-TRAN® for two pairs of IGBTs and diodes used in bidirectional circuits in their products and, more importantly, be a potential replacement for conventional power switches, such as IGBTs, in the broader power semiconductor market.",
        "start_character": 14283,
        "end_character": 14814
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-009995",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-009995-f7ef004add88650b",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-009995",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In August 2025, we secured an order from Stellantis for custom development and packaged devices targeting multiple EV applications.",
        "start_character": 4249,
        "end_character": 4380
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-009995",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-009995-f7ef004add88650b",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-009995",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In February 2026, we entered into a multi-year strategic cooperation agreement with this customer for the design, development and worldwide sales of circuit protection solutions including SSCBs, battery disconnect units and EV contactors featuring B-TRAN®.",
        "start_character": 6704,
        "end_character": 6960
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-009995",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-009995-f7ef004add88650b",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-009995",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we treat the proprietary dual-sided wafer fabrication process we developed to produce B-TRAN® wafers as a trade secret.",
        "start_character": 19768,
        "end_character": 19900
      }
    ]
